---
title: Gimlet
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 13 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz}, @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz} and @simple syrup{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled). Garnish with a @lime{1%wheel}.

> The older spec is gin and sweetened lime cordial, two to one.
